## Scripts d'ops — squelette robuste

```bash
#!/bin/bash
set -euo pipefail

ENV="${1:-}"
if [[ -z "$ENV" ]]; then
  echo "Usage: $0 <recette|preprod|prod>" >&2
  exit 1
fi

if [[ "$ENV" == "prod" ]]; then
  read -rp "⚠️  Déploiement PRODUCTION. Confirmer (yes/no) ? " confirm
  [[ "$confirm" == "yes" ]] || { echo "Annulé."; exit 0; }
fi
```

